/// FHIR Address type
///
/// Address Type: An address expressed using postal conventions (as opposed to
/// GPS or other location definition formats). This data type may be used to
/// convey addresses for use in delivering mail as well as for visiting locations
/// which might not be valid for mail delivery. There are a variety of postal
/// address formats defined around the world.
