    /// See guidance around (not) making local changes to elements
    /// [here](canonicalresource.html#localization).
    ///
    /// ## Cardinality: Optional, Multiple (0..*)
    ///
    /// ## Constraints
    /// - **ele-1**: All FHIR elements must have a @value or children (error)
